# Only ever commit encrypted material from this directory.
#
# `load-secrets.sh --encrypt <NAME>` writes <NAME>.age here from the plaintext
# in your local store; the plaintext itself belongs in $SECRETS_DIR
# (~/.config/marisstella/secrets by default), never in the repository. This
# file is deny-by-default rather than a list of extensions to avoid, because a
# list of extensions is a list somebody adds a secret outside of.
*
!.gitignore
!registry.tsv
!recipients.txt
!*.age
